      "markdown": "## 奇点分类（III）\n\n•  $ \\Delta = 0 $ A，有两个相同的特征值\n\n $$ \\begin{array}{l}\\mathbf{P}\\xi\\xi\\left(\\begin{array}{l l l}1&2\\end{array}\\right)&\\mathbf{P}^{-1}\\mathbf{A}\\mathbf{P}=\\left(\\begin{array}{l l}\\lambda&&\\\\ &\\lambda\\end{array}\\right)\\\\ d u&\\\\ \\end{array} $$ \n\n $$ \\begin{cases}\\frac{du}{dt}=\\lambda u\\\\\\frac{dv}{dt}=\\lambda v\\end{cases}\\begin{cases}u=u_{0}e^{\\lambda t}&\\quad\\frac{u}{v}=\\frac{u_{0}}{v_{0}}\\\\v=v_{0}e^{\\lambda t}&\\quad v=v_{0}\\end{cases} $$ \n\n $$ \\bullet \\quad \\alpha<0,\\lambda<0 $$ \n\n数学建模\n\n $$ \\bullet \\quad \\alpha>0,\\lambda>0 $$ \n\n $$ \\frac{d\\mathbf{u}}{dt}=\\mathbf{P}^{-1}\\mathbf{A}\\mathbf{P}\\mathbf{u} $$ \n\n $$ \\alpha=\\mathrm{tr}(\\mathbf{A})=\\lambda_{1}+\\lambda_{2} $$ \n\n $$ \\boldsymbol{\\beta}=\\mid\\mathbf{A}\\mid=\\lambda_{1}\\lambda_{2} $$ \n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_2049_1003_2946_1562.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"29%\" /></div>\n",
